Z||000013||Songman||08-08-2001||02:56 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Raydar:<BR><B> I think Sammy Hagar was the best thing that ever happened to Van Halen. Too bad they parted company.<BR>David Lee Roth sucks. His ego wouldn't even fit on the album cover.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Okay, so we don't agree on everything! hehe<BR>You're still a pretty cool guy!<P>Dave's ego was just as much a part of that band as Eddie's guitar playing.. It was the 80's. It was rock n' roll.. Name me any rock singer from that era without an ego and I'll show you a group that never made it. It was the charisma of the generation... And I loved Dave's solo stuff too. His Blues influence really came out then...<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000014||AkursedX||08-08-2001||03:35 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Galen:<BR><B>Ani DiFranco rocks   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> just figured I'd add that lil bit in hehe<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I met her a couple of times (She's from Buffalo)  She's real cool.  Probably one of the most sincere people I've ever met.  And she is AWESOME live  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>And Garbage is another female band that doesn't sing about love all the time. <BR><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
