Z||000016||saleenfiero||08-08-2001||07:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by lou_dias:<BR><B>Bills, Bills, Bills by Destiny's Child.<BR>but what an annoying song.<P>When I was 20 Anthrax was my favorite band.  Too bad they started to suck after they kicked Joey out.  Kinda like Metallica and Dave Mustaine or Motely Crue and Vince Neil or Van Halen and David Lee Roth or Black Sabbath and Ozzy<P>but unlike Slayer and David Lombardo...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Hey!  Anthrax is way better without Joey.  They turned into a solid metal band instead of half assed rockity metal.  They had to evolve or else they would be gone today.  Pretty much same with any metal band still in existence.  Although I will never forgive Steven Tyler for that Britney duet at the superbowl.  But seriously, you guys did make your point.<BR>I realize most everybody has pounded out at least one love song, but you listen to any of the mainstream ones and they just seem so limited.  Oh well, I've been proved wrong.  You people are too damn smart.<BR><P>------------------<BR>'86 SE - My car is actually a MacLaren F1 with a Fiero body kit; or not.||||reg||1
Z||000017||Urchin||08-08-2001||09:30 PM||||I think it depends a lot on the genre.   Rap/dance girls typically trash men or just simply spell out how they don't need one.  Country/easy listening; the typical love seekers (at least in their music).  Most of the music I listen to is heavier or 70s to 80s punk ...not main stream.  They tend to touch on more serious topics.  The Poison Girls is a good example.  <P>Women in bands like "Destiny's Child" just irritate me.  (no offence meant to anyone)<BR>Anyone ever notice that throughout their "Charlie's Angles" song entitled "Independant Women" they speak solely of how "independant" they are, and yet they work for a man...ie. Charlie<P>I'm not attempting to start a sex war, just pointing out that the song was poorly written.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/new_3.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
